# Calera Math — Steers Class Board
# Never commit secrets. The Firebase web settings in js/firebaseConfig.js are
# public by design (every Firebase site ships them); they are not secrets.
# Real secrets live in GitHub repository secrets, Firebase Functions secrets,
# or the teacher's own account. Never add a .env, key file or service account here.
